llvmpipe seems to fail on NetBSD-11:

UNREACHABLE executed at /home/netbsd/netbsd-11/src/external/apache2/llvm/librt/libLLVMCodeGen/../../lib/../dist/llvm/lib/CodeGen/TargetSchedule.cpp:246!
Abort (core dumped) 

A workaround is to start with softpipe rather than llvmpipe:
GALLIUM_DRIVER=softpipe prusa-slicer

Alternately, I've found a kernel patch works, attached in:
https://gnats.netbsd.org/60614

This package has known vulnerabilities, please investigate and fix if possible:
  CVE-2020-28595, CVE-2020-28596
